<Layout title="Privacy notice"><PageHero eyebrow="PRIVACY NOTICE" title="Your information, handled thoughtfully." text="How the website collects and uses your registration information."/><article class="container prose"><p>Effective 11 November 2026. This notice applies to the Verto Immigration Inc. website and initial registration service.</p><h2>Who collects your information</h2><p>Verto Immigration Inc. collects the information you submit to understand your request, contact you and manage your intake. For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:travel@vertoimmigrationinc.com">travel@vertoimmigrationinc.com</a>.</p><h2>What we collect</h2><p>The registration form collects your name, contact details, citizenship, country of residence, age range, service interest and relevant background. Depending on your service, this may include a short work history, education level, job-offer status or proposed travel plans. We also record your consent, registration time and intake status.</p><p>Do not submit passport numbers, banking details, medical records or unrelated sensitive information. This initial form does not accept document uploads.</p><h2>Why we use it</h2><p>We use your information to review and respond to your enquiry, discuss services and fees, administer the agreed service, maintain appropriate records and protect the website from abuse. Registration does not subscribe you to marketing messages.</p><h2>Hosting, security and service providers</h2><p>The website and registration service are designed to operate on Cloudflare. Registration records are held in server-side storage and accessed through an authenticated staff service. Cloudflare Turnstile is used to help prevent automated submissions. Providers may process information outside your country of residence, subject to their applicable policies and safeguards.</p><p>When payment is enabled and you choose to pay, Stripe processes payment information directly. We send Stripe your email and registration reference to reconcile the payment. Verto’s website does not receive or store your full card number. The merchant identity is disclosed before checkout.</p><h2>Your private reference</h2><p>Your access key and tracking link allow you to view a limited intake status. Keep them confidential. The tracking page does not display your full registration answers. Contact Verto if your access key is lost or exposed.</p><h2>Drafts and browser storage</h2><p>If you select “Save draft for this session,” your answers are stored in your browser’s session storage so you can return during that session. They are not sent to Verto until you submit. Clear the draft on shared devices. A saved draft is removed after successful submission. Essential security and payment features may use cookies or similar technologies. The site does not add advertising analytics.</p><h2>Retention, access and correction</h2><p>Verto retains information as needed to respond to your request, perform agreed services and meet applicable recordkeeping obligations. Ask Verto about the retention period for your circumstances before submitting if this affects your decision. To request access, correction or deletion, contact the address above. We may need to verify your identity and may need to retain records where required.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can contact Verto by phone instead of registering online. You can withdraw consent to further enquiry contact, subject to any ongoing service agreement or legal obligations. No system can guarantee absolute security; contact us promptly if you have a concern.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>We may update this notice as the service changes. The effective date above identifies the current version.</p></article></Layout>
